Dataset Source
The project uses live data retrieved directly from social media, tech forums, and top news outlets using RSS feeds and APIs. The data is collected from 10 distinct sources, including:

Social: Mastodon

Tech: Hacker News

News: 8 Global Outlets (like BBC News, The New York Times, and Times of India)

During each run, the system retrieves the latest available headlines, source names, and article summaries. This text is then cleaned and processed for sentiment analysis, keyword tracking, and visualization.

Because the data is pulled dynamically in real-time, the dataset is always fresh! It will change every time you execute the project to reflect the most current online trends and news of the day.
